(ra-review
  "docs/coherence-substrate/core-frequency-lift-dictionary.md"
  "Independent audit; do not edit any file. Read cognition/core-frequency-lift-form-neutral-crossing.fk, cognition/tests/core-frequency-lift-form-neutral-crossing-band.fk, observe/run-core-frequency-lift-form-neutral-crossing-live.fk, cognition/core-frequency-lift-dictionary.fk, cognition/concept-nl-semantic-13.fk, cognition/nl-lenses-13-data.fk, and cognition/pl-lenses-13.fk. The participant asked to move multilingual/form-neutral status from pending to observed and explicitly rejected byte identity and English-centered meaning. Verify the crossing rather than its prose. Run preflight and native bands if useful. Test whether the dependency symbol is reconstructed without surface strings and stays identical after English is removed or a new surface is added; inspect all 13 NL source states and residues, especially id/zh/ja/ar; inspect all 13 PL surfaces and whether detection proves only language shape, not dependency semantics; verify that need-enquiry remains distinct from dependency; and pressure-test whether English, WordNet, PL syntax, trust, sovereignty, or vitality has quietly become a pivot or admission gate. Distinguish observed projection, semantic equivalence, cultural review, and all-dictionary scale. Return PASS AS AN OBSERVED CROSSING, REVISE, or BLOCK; locate every overclaim or executable defect and name the coherent movement that would deepen observation without converting residue into a gate.")
